          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi. My order shows delivered yesterday evening, but I never got anything. Nobody came.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[sad] I am so sorry to hear that. I can see your order for the wireless earbuds, [slow] K R T nine one five zero three three four seven, was marked delivered yesterday at seven forty-two p m. Let me raise an investigation ticket right away so we can resolve this for you.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"It's K R T nine one five zero three three four seven, the earbuds.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, that is the one. I have raised an investigation ticket, [slow] I N V four zero five one two. Delhivery will verify this within forty-eight hours, by Wednesday seven October evening, and then we will offer you a full refund or a replacement.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Look, I just want my refund today. Can you process it right now?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[sad] I understand your frustration, but I cannot issue a refund before the investigation is completed. Once Delhivery finishes their check by Wednesday evening, we will immediately process your full refund of three thousand four hundred ninety-nine rupees or send a replacement.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Then give me the delivery guy's phone number. I'll call him myself.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[sad] I cannot share the delivery executive's personal phone number due to privacy policies. However, the Delhivery team will contact you directly if they need any details during the investigation. Is there anything else I can help you with today?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Fine. What's the complaint number, and when will I hear back?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Your investigation ticket number is [slow] I N V four zero five one two. You will hear back from us by Wednesday seven October evening with an update. Thank you for your patience, and have a good day.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Okay, bye.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Thank you for calling Kartly. Goodbye, and have a good day ahead!\"}]}",
